          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiteri okoarigania omorwoti na Hamani ase omoyega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatato Esiteri akabeeka chianga chiaye chi’oboting’ana, akagenda agatenena ase egoora ya ime, ase enyomba y’omorwoti erochie enyomba enene y’omorwoti. Omorwoti nigo aikaransete ase ekerogo kiaye ki’oborwoti kerochie gesieri ki’enyomba yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti aroche Esiteri eting’ana oteneine ase egoora, Esiteri akanyora ogwancherwa asare. Omorwoti akamworotera enyimbo yaye y’oborwoti eroisirie korwa ase etaabu, arenge nero koboko. Erio Esiteri akagenda gochia ang’e, agakuna mesia y’enyimbo eria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na omorwoti akamobooria, “Eting’ana Esiteri, ninki origetie? Inteebia eki oganetie; aye nokeegwe, nakeba nonya nekeng’ese ki’oborwoti bwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteri akairaneria, “Koranche omorwoti, ochiche mwane reero, aye amo na Hamani, ase endagera nakoroiseirie aye omorwoti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akarwa ogochika Hamani aretwe ase obwango, erinde banyare gokora aya Esiteri aganetie. Agwo omorwoti na Hamani bakagenda ase endagera eria Esiteri aroisetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero baare konywa edivai, omorwoti akaboria Esiteri, “Ninki origetie? Ekio nokeegwe. Ninki oganetie? Nakeba nonya nekeng’ese ki’oborwoti bwane, nokeegwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteri akairaneria, “Ogosaba kwane na okogania kwane noko:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye nanyorire ogwancherwa ase obosio bwao, aye omorwoti, koranche aye amo na Hamani, ankio naende moche mobe abageni baane ase endagera ndache mbaroiserie. Ase ekero ekio nario ndache ngoteebie eki nganetie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani ogokora omooroberio bw’ogoita Moredekai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria Hamani akarua ase endagera eria, ore nomogooko na omosasoko. Korende ekero aroche Moredekai ase egeita ki’enyomba y’omorwoti, na Moredekai taimogete atenene amworokie amasikani, agaichorwa nekeririanda asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende agetanga ase okoremereria, akagenda inka bwoye. Erio akarangeria abasani baye, na Seresi mokaye, bache mwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani agetogia ase bare, agakwana igoro y’obonge bw’obotenenku bwaye, na igoro y’abana baye abange, naende igoro y’obonene bwonsi omorwoti konya amoeire, na buna amokinetie kobua abagaambi bonsi, na abasomba bonsi b’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Hamani akabora, “Esiteri eting’ana, moka omorwoti, naroisia endagera, tarangeretie onde otatiga inche bweka amo nomorwoti. Nonya ng’ankio nagatorangeretie, inche amo nomorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende amang’ana ayio onsi tabwati engencho ase inde ekero nkorora Moredekai, Omoyahudi oria, oikaransete ase egeita ki’omorwoti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Seresi mokaye, na abasani baye bonsi bakamosemia iga, “Tiga orobambo rore nobotambe bw’amaboko emerongo etano rosimisigwe, erio ankio mambia oborie omorwoti ng’a Moredekai atongwe igoro ase orobambo orwo, erinde ogende ase omoyega kore nomogooko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana erio rikagokia Hamani; ere agasimisia orobambo orwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
